within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.A_AlimentaryTractAndMetabolism.A10B_BloodGlucoseLoweringDrugsExclInsulins.A10BX16_Tirzepatide;
model Tirzepatide_Chigutsa2025_PD_fat_mass
  "indirect_response_i exposure-response sweep — Chigutsa_2025 :: fat mass (fat mass)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Interfaces.PartialExposureResponseSweep(
    E0 = 45,      // [kg; kg × 1]
    Emax = 0.319,  // type I effect term
    EC50 = 0.000518,  // [kg/m3; ng/mL × 1e-06]
    gamma = 1,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng/mL per second
equation
  response = E0*(1 - Emax*frac);   // steady state, indirect response type I
  // defaulted: gamma
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 5200, Interval = 10.4),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Tirzepatide_Chigutsa2025_PD_fat_mass</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Chigutsa E et al., <i>Clinical pharmacology and therapeutics 118(6):1489–1498</i> 2025 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/cpt.3750\">doi:10.1002/cpt.3750</a>) — fat mass [kg] against tirzepatide ng/mL — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: indirect_response_i.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =         45 kg       drug-free response (baseline) (Baseline fat mass, Q324)
  Emax  =      0.319          maximal effect term (Maximum effect for drug inhibiting formation of fat mass, Q323)
  EC50  =        518 ng/mL    exposure at half of the maximal effect term (IC50 for drug inhibiting formation of fat mass, Q322)
  gamma = (library default) Hill coefficient</pre><p>The algebra is <code>response = E0*(1 - Emax*frac)</code>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng/mL of tirzepatide per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 45   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (518 ng/mL)  response 37.82
  exposure -> infinity  response 30.65</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Chigutsa_2025: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Tirzepatide_Chigutsa2025_PD_fat_mass;
